{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22514","headline":"妇人苦 · 白居易","name":"妇人苦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉鬓加意梳，蛾眉用心埽。\n几度晓妆成，君看不言好。\n妾身重同穴，君意轻偕老。\n惆怅去年来，心知未能道。\n今朝一开口，语少意何深。\n愿引他时事，移君此日心。\n人言夫妇亲，义合如一身。\n及至死生际，何曾苦乐均。\n妇人一丧夫，终身守孤孑。\n有如林中竹，忽被风吹折。\n一折不重生，枯死犹抱节。\n男儿若丧妇，能不暂伤情。\n应似门前柳，逢春易发荣。\n风吹一枝折，还有一枝生。\n爲君委曲言，愿君再三听。\n须知妇人苦，从此莫相轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}